# License Boundary for Source-Available Mixed-Source Workbench

This repository is a source-available mixed-source documentation and local
tooling workbench. It is not presented as a single conventional open-source
distribution in which every committed file has been cleared and relicensed by
the repository contributors.

## Scope Of MIT Permission

Subject to the exclusions below, the MIT License text applies only to original
material authored specifically for this repository, such as original
repository-authored documentation, local workflow notes, generated diagrams, and
glue material.

For files that combine original repository-authored material with imported,
adapted, user-provided, reference, or third-party material, this permission
applies only to the original repository-authored portions. It does not override
or replace any rights retained by the original source of the non-original
portions.

## Material Not Covered By This Grant

This license grant does not apply to:

- Imported, adapted, or user-provided skill documents, examples, scripts,
  templates, or binary assets that originated outside this repository and may
  retain separate rights.
- Third-party dependencies declared in package manifests or required by the
  scripts.
- Names, logos, trademarks, service marks, or platform identifiers belonging to
  OpenAI, Anthropic, Microsoft, or any other third party.
- Local runtime state and generated outputs that are intentionally not committed
  to this repository.

If a file or directory states a different license or provenance boundary, that
more specific notice controls for that material.

